[{"code":"record_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":18,"col":10},"end":{"line":18,"col":21}},"title":"RECORD MAY BE SHARED","message":"`update` changes the record at `model`, `model.w1` and `model.w2` in place, and\nthe checker cannot show that nothing else still holds the record.\n\n18|        (Tea.sandbox\n            ^^^^^^^^^^^ the runtime hands `update` the model here\n\nBuild the messages the page sends from values that are not the model's records,\nfind the model's own record by its key, or have `update` change a copy of what a\nmessage carries, made with `Record.copy`.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: a message a view event\nbuilds may hold it — a list of the model, or one a handler keeps from one\ndispatch to the next — and the check does not tell update's arms apart."}]
